---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home"
  description="Steven Clarke - Senior Software Engineer. Media supply chain, consulting, and AI-enabled product engineering."
>
  <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-center">
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">
        Senior Software Engineer
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Turning ambiguous problems into reliable software.
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        I build media supply-chain applications and complex systems with breadth across
        organizations, clear stakeholder alignment, and pragmatic delivery under constraints. I
        adapt quickly to new tools, including agentic AI and LLM workflows, while drawing on
        experience building software before the AI era.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          class="rounded-full bg-teal-600 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-teal-700 dark:bg-teal-500 dark:hover:bg-teal-400"
          href="/projects"
        >
          View projects
        </a>
        <a
          class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400"
          href="/resume.pdf"
        >
          Download resume
        </a>
        <a
          class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400"
          href="/contact"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-lg dark:border-slate-800">
        <img
          src="/images/headshot.jpg"
          alt="Portrait of Steven Clarke"
          class="h-full w-full max-w-sm object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16 space-y-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Selected projects</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Four projects spanning fitness, computer vision, media metadata, and this portfolio.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-300"
        href="/projects"
      >
        See all projects →
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">Strength training</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">Iron Altar</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          A strength-training application focused on clear programming and tracking.
        </p>
        <a
          class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-300"
          href="/projects/iron-altar"
        >
          Read case study →
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">Computer vision</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">Squat Monster</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Bar-path analysis using computer vision to analyze barbell lifts.
        </p>
        <a
          class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-300"
          href="/projects/squat-monster"
        >
          Read case study →
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">Media metadata</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">Media Inspector</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Inspects media-file metadata and generates a Media Manifest Core specification file.
        </p>
        <a
          class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-300"
          href="/projects/media-inspector"
        >
          Read case study →
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg dark:border-slate-800">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">Portfolio</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">Portfolio Website</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Astro, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, AWS infrastructure as code, CI/CD, and preview
          deployments.
        </p>
        <a
          class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-300"
          href="/projects/portfolio-website"
        >
          Read case study →
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-8 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Core strengths</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Breadth from consulting, clarity with stakeholders, and delivery under time and resource
          constraints. Focus on practical engineering and measurable outcomes through better
          alignment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-slate-800">
          Media supply chain
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-slate-800">
          TypeScript / Node
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-slate-800">
          AWS / Infrastructure as Code
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-slate-800">
          Agentic AI / LLM workflows
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-slate-800">
          Stakeholder alignment
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm dark:border-slate-800">
          Testing & reliability
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
